  "description": "## Feature\n\nAdded **Web Clipboard**.\n\nOnce enabled, it allows clipboard content to be synced between desktop browsers on the same local network and a patched Gboard instance, with support for:\n\n- Sending text from the browser to the phone\n- Syncing the phone clipboard to the browser\n- 4-digit pairing code verification\n- Quick Settings toggle\n- Built-in Web UI bundled directly with the patch\n\n## 功能\n\n新增 **Web Clipboard** 功能。\n\n啟用後，可以讓同一個區域網路中的桌面瀏覽器與已套用 patch 的 Gboard 之間同步剪貼簿內容，支援：\n\n- 瀏覽器傳送文字到手機\n- 手機剪貼簿同步到瀏覽器\n- 4 碼配對碼驗證\n- 快速設定開關\n- 內建 Web UI，直接隨 patch 一起提供\n",
